# dl_toolbox structure

Package: `src/dl_toolbox/`
Contracts: `.cursor/rules/` — same relative path as the package, `.mdc` instead of `.py`.

This file is a **pointer**. Before using a row marked CONTRACT, Read that `.mdc`. Do not rely on memory.

Keep this index in sync with `DL_projects/.cursor/rules/dl_toolbox_structure.mdc` (same rows; paths here are from this package root). When the workspace is `DL_projects`, prefer the workspace-root copy of this index (it has `dl_toolbox/` prefixes).

## Prefs

- `.cursor/rules/python_preferences.mdc` — no parameter defaults; large signatures become config objects
- `.cursor/rules/terminology_preferences.mdc` — spatial dims are `Y_dim` / `X_dim`, never height/width
- `.cursor/rules/contract_driven_development.mdc` — how to add the next contract

